    "badge": "Best Overall",
    "category": "Inline Filter or With Showerhead, 10,000 Gallons",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "description": "The Aquasana AQ-4100 is our pick because it pairs a clear, specific claim with a long cartridge life. Aquasana says it was independently tested to NSF/ANSI 177 and reduces over 90% of chlorine for 10,000 gallons or up to six months, with the details on its performance data sheet. That is the kind of claim you can hold a brand to: a standard, a reduction level and a rated life. Aquasana sells a version with its own adjustable showerhead and an AQ-4100NSH version that installs between your pipe and the showerhead you already own, and it recommends keeping flow around 2.5 gallons per minute, warning that higher flow can reduce filtration. Like every pick here, it targets chlorine; it will not soften hard water.",
    "pros": [
      "Tested to NSF/ANSI 177 with over 90% chlorine reduction per Aquasana",
