    "cons": [
      "90-day cartridge replacement",
      "Chloramine claim is not independently tested per Canopy's own note",
      "Showerhead style is fixed"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The best choice for chloramine-treated water, with media chosen for it and unusually candid labeling about what is and is not tested."
  },
  {
    "id": "culligan-wsh-c125",
    "name": "Culligan WSH-C125 Wall-Mounted Shower Filter",
    "badge": "Best Budget Certified",
